  "title": "Warmly Spiced Australian Lentil Curry",
  "description": "A garlicky and flavorful Australian dish made with red lentils and a blend of warming spices, perfect for a midnight craving. This Jain-friendly curry is cooked in a kazan-cauldron with high heat cooking oil.",
