  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a kazan-cauldron over high heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it starts to brown.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder, turmeric, and cumin and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lentils, salt, and water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Use a slotted spoon to remove any excess oil that rises to the surface.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
